Package: amogos-archive-keyring
Version: 2.0.0-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AmogOS
Depends: apt (>= 1.1)
Description: AmogOS archive signing key and APT source
 Installs the scoped public archive key and the stable AmogOS repository
 for Debian 13 amd64. Debian remains the source of system dependencies.
